Security test plan — Hausa
Identity and invitation
[ ]
No session => reject.
[ ]
AAL1 => reject admin nomination, review, grant and revoke.
[ ]
Active non-super-admin => reject all admin management operations.
[ ]
Expired, revoked, already-used or malformed token => reject.
[ ]
Replay same token concurrently => only one submission accepted.
[ ]
Pi UID not bound to Mainnet public.users => reject.
[ ]
Pi UID and Supabase Auth UID mismatch/unbound => reject.
[ ]
Client-supplied role/user ID cannot override server-derived identity.
Role scope
[ ]
Contributor Admin can only access explicitly allowed contributor queue/tasks.
[ ]
Contributor Admin cannot read finance, treasury, investor balances, withdrawal queues or private admin records.
[ ]
Contributor Admin cannot call grant/revoke role RPCs or create invitations.
[ ]
Contributor Admin cannot become super_admin or alter own role.
[ ]
Direct REST/table access is denied by grants/RLS.
[ ]
Revocation immediately denies next API/RPC request.
[ ]
Core, internal and external scopes remain unchanged.
[ ]
Mainnet and Testnet data never mix; Testnet has no independent admin login.
Selfie and privacy
[ ]
No gallery/file input is present in UI.
[ ]
Denying camera permission blocks submission.
[ ]
No camera device or insecure context blocks capture with clear message.
[ ]
Client MIME/size spoofing rejected server-side.
[ ]
Oversized/corrupt/non-image upload rejected.
[ ]
Private bucket cannot be read by anon or unrelated authenticated user.
[ ]
Signed URL expires promptly and cannot be reused beyond expiry.
[ ]
No selfie bytes, raw token or auth token in logs.
[ ]
Retention/deletion job and deletion audit are tested.
[ ]
Camera capture is not falsely described as liveness verification.
Audit and regression
[ ]
Every nomination, profile access, review, grant, revoke and deletion is audited.
[ ]
Audit records cannot be updated/deleted by ordinary admin.
[ ]
Rejected review requires a reason.
[ ]
Existing Core invitation, project-scoped roles, MFA, investor dashboard, treasury, withdrawals and Pi payment gates remain unchanged.
[ ]
Unit, API integration, RLS and negative authorization tests pass before release.
[ ]
No production data is used for synthetic tests.
